  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into 1cm-thick wedges.\n• Place pumpkin wedges on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with Nan's special seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out the seeds, if necessary!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8609d0d0527cba53b3ac3/step-88e3bb00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice kale, discarding any larger pieces of stalk.\n• Thinly slice red radish and Quke into rounds. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large bowl, combine the vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil. Add kale, massaging leaves to soften. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8609d0d0527cba53b3ac3/step-efda9c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes and mash to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8609d0d0527cba53b3ac3/step-0a8e3b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the pumpkin has 5 minutes remaining, to bowl with kale, add Qukes, radish, spinach & rocket mix and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8609d0d0527cba53b3ac3/step-133a6130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave honey mustard sauce until warmed through, 30 seconds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8609d0d0527cba53b3ac3/step-6cf79f40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide supergreen Quke salad between bowls then top with roast pumpkin and garlic fetta.\n• Drizzle over honey mustard sauce. Garnish with flaked almonds and tear over mint to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8609d0d0527cba53b3ac3/step-f83b3650.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
